{
  "//": [
    "Core and item declarations that were pub(crate) before the kernel split and are pub",
    "since only because a check raised above their crate names them (ledger lines 1531 C1,",
    "1795 S3.2b): load product code could name each before the split and can now, so none",
    "is newly exposed; they are 1531 C1's debt, visible here rather than marked one by one.",
    "Generated once from the split's visibility log (~/ferrix-logs/bs-a/s3b/raise-log.jsonl",
    "on nazuna). kernel-interface.py --check fails on a pub declaration used above only by",
    "checks that is neither CHECKS-ONLY nor listed, and on an entry that is no longer pub,",
    "is used by a higher crate's product code now (a change to the interface), is used by",
    "no check, or was narrower than pub(crate). The list may shrink and never grow."
  ],
